Error: Jet.InvalidRoute: HTTP route method `joke` needs read-only self and a concrete signature
  --> Tests/UI/http_route_mutable_self.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     #Server.Get("/jokes") joke: fn(^self) -> HTTPResponse HTTPError! {
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
